        "subject": "Studio: redesigned itinerary editor (tabs, page content per language, PDF upload, guide)",
        "body": "Studio: redesigned itinerary editor (tabs, page content per language, PDF upload, guide)\n\n- List as cards: cover, status (draft/published/hidden), price, sales; search,\n  filter (incl. hidden), duplicate, hide, delete (blocked when it has buyers).\n- Editor in seven tabs: basics, page content (every public block per ar/en/id,\n  benefit list with icon picker, how-it-works steps, section show/hide/order),\n  FAQ, private days, pricing, PDF (drag & drop with progress, what-is-sent per\n  language, history, preview/download), preview. Each tab saves only its own\n  fields; unsaved-changes warning; «؟ دليل» guide panel per tab (ar/en/id).\n- Migration 0049: itineraries.page_content (backfilled to the current order);\n  public page reads it with translation fallback; DTO allow-list + leak tests.\n- PDF upload: proxyClientMaxBodySize 25mb (proxy cut bodies at 10 MB), clear\n  Arabic storage error, one deliveredPdf rule shared with delivery.\n- Audit for create/update/duplicate/hide/show/page content/FAQ/upload/delete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Rhcg1nc6tRTvhEFMLi883G\n",
